      "position": {
        "x": -460,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Early stopping as a recipe: hold out a validation split, train for up to 200 epochs, and stop once the validation loss has not improved for 10 epochs. TrainingLoop then restores the weights of the best epoch, not the last one. Here the best epoch is 12 and training stops after 22; CheckpointSaver stores those best weights as digits-best.pt in the models directory, and the held-out test split scores them at 0.969.\n\n把 early stopping 當成標準做法：切出一份驗證資料，最多訓練 200 個 epoch，驗證 loss 連續 10 個 epoch 沒有進步就停。TrainingLoop 接著會還原最佳那個 epoch 的權重，而不是最後一個。這裡最佳的是第 12 個 epoch，訓練在第 22 個之後停下；CheckpointSaver 把這組最佳權重存成 models 目錄裡的 digits-best.pt，保留的測試資料給它的分數是 0.969。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -460,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-split",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 1440,
        "y": -420
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Three splits, three jobs: the training split updates the weights, the validation split decides when to stop, and the test split is used once at the end. Choosing the stopping point on the test split would make its score optimistic.\n\n三份資料各有用途：訓練資料用來更新權重，驗證資料決定何時停下，測試資料只在最後用一次。如果用測試資料來決定停在哪裡，它的分數就會偏樂觀。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "split-val",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -420
        },
        "noteWidth": 320
      }
    }
